{"reviews":[{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-0","r":3.0,"t":"Alright, I'm hoping I'll get used to them","x":"The patterns and colors are nice, sweet and they look cute on. They seem well made, sewn together by a good seam at the nape of the neck.  But, they are smallish and so after awhile they either hurt my ears or if I put them under my ears then they ride up. To stretch them I put all of them on my round yoga bolster so they could stretch out over night and that seemed to help. Perhaps I'll do that again and see if they feel more comfortable. The other complaint I have is that they are double thick","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-1","r":4.0,"t":"Beautiful","x":"Some of the headband are tighter than others but they're all beautiful. The patterns and colors are gorgeous and they're nicely made. They can come &#34;undone&#34; in terms of the little knot/twist part straughting out randomly, but it eventually fixes with a couple wears. I do put a few bobby pins in the layer that isn't showing just to keep them secured exactly where I want because they can ride up a little bit.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-2","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect Headbands","x":"I love them!!! Great quality, nice fit not too tight or loose. Very happy with purchase...","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-3","r":5.0,"t":"Cute, functional, worth it.","x":"I work as a waitress at a country club, so I'm working for up to 10 hours nonstop during weddings, bridal/baby showers, and other big events. So, I needed a headband that would hang on all night and stay in one place, and one that wouldn't give me a headache from being too tight. And these check all those boxes off.  If you're looking for a headband that will stay in one place, look cute, and not squeeze your head, these are for you.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-4","r":4.0,"t":"Cut them down-too bulky!","x":"I am in LOVE with the designs, although I did not care for the bulky double layer. I chose to use a pair of sewing scissors and cut off one of the layers, and now I am back in love (using my husband's account for Prime). -Michelle","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great buy!","x":"Cute! Great for those &#34;I'm feeling lazy but I still want to be cute&#34; days. They look just like the picture and have a good stretch. My head is large but I can wear these all day without getting a headache.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-6","r":5.0,"t":"Fantastic headbands","x":"Absolutely love these! They are the only headband tight enough to hold my hair back but still not give me a headache. I only wished they came in more of a variety like solid colors.  Tonie S.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-7","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect cute headband","x":"It stays on my head really well. I had a biology lab outside and I went to work and I never had to adjust the headband at all. The patterns are so cute too","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-8","r":4.0,"t":"Love the designs","x":"Love the designs! Not a ton of elastic in them, so they aren't terrific as staying in place. Five bands for the price is great!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-9","r":5.0,"t":"Cute headbands","x":"I love the headbands. I bought them for me and my daughter for te beach and they worked perfect! Love them!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-10","r":5.0,"t":"comfortable, they don't slide around","x":"Soft, comfortable, they don't slide around, pretty patterns.  I love them!!  I want more","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-11","r":4.0,"t":"works great","x":"very cute headbands, my 16 yr old daughter immediately grabbed a few, fit great.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-12","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love these! Have gotten complimented every time I've worn them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-13","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Great quality and love the patterns! I can't wait to wear them!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-14","r":5.0,"t":"very satisfied with my purchase","x":"Cute designs, very satisfied with my purchase.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-15","r":3.0,"t":"They are great for facewashing/housework etc but","x":"They are cute, but my main issue is that the 2 pieces that go over the ears pull apart, so my ears can poke through- it's not one piece of fabric, it's 2 pieces sewn together to make the &#34;turban&#34; style. They are great for facewashing/housework etc but, for me, I'd rather have a headband that was one piece of fabric so I don't have to pull at it constantly :)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-16","r":4.0,"t":"Good, cute product for the price","x":"These are so cute and exactly what I was looking for.  I gave them four stars because one of the five was a little tight on my head - the rest fit nicely though.  Also, I was hoping they'd look cute with my hair both up AND down but that isn't the case - they only look good with my hair down.  Anyway, good product for the price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-17","r":3.0,"t":"I'm not very much into the flower patterns on these ...","x":"I'm not very much into the flower patterns on these headbands, the patterns look so outdated to me.  Headbands are very stretchy and I had to constantly adjust my headband, it just didn't stay put.  These would be much nicer if they were a different pattern besides flowers and if the headband was one very wide headband.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-18","r":3.0,"t":"I have fine hair and apparently a small head","x":"Lots of fabric. I have fine hair and apparently a small head. I ended up cutting one of the loops off of each headband and making extra headbands for my 2 year old daughter. So I guess it was double the value because I made 10 headbands for the price of 5? Fabric is pretty and  decently stretchy.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-19","r":4.0,"t":"Nice!","x":"These are really fun and use because of the color selection.  The only thing I wish it had was some rubber or something on the part that goes behind your head because it seems to creep up during the day and then I have to take it off and put it back on.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-20","r":3.0,"t":"Either I have a tiny weird head or these run ...","x":"Either I have a tiny weird head or these run a little big. I don't usually have a problem with headbands at all (with sizes) but these seem to slip off. Don't fit tight as it shows in the pictures :( they are CUTE, but too big","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-21","r":5.0,"t":"... ordered the A-5 color set and they are vey nice. They are secure without being overly tight","x":"I ordered the A-5 color set and they are vey nice. They are secure without being overly tight. Which is good in my case since I have pretty big head in general which gets even bigger when I wear my hair in an afro or a wig.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-22","r":5.0,"t":"I love having so many cute colors to choose from","x":"These are so cute and comfy, I use them while I apply makeup and to keep my bangs off of my skin while I sleep. I love having so many cute colors to choose from, and the extra wide band makes them super comfy.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-23","r":4.0,"t":"Very stylish!","x":"These headbands are really cute and fit good although at times I have trouble getting them in and also a hard time having them stay. But for $10 you can\u2019t beat them!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B06XFL9YYL-24","r":3.0,"t":"Fit a little tight","x":"They fit a little tight. They are bright and colorful and are very cute, but they still slip off your head easily. I have long straight hair.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the cute designs, patterns, and colors.","cites":[1,2,5,8,9,11,14,15]},{"text":"Many say the headbands are comfortable, stay in place, and don't cause headaches.","cites":[3,4,6,7,8,11]},{"text":"Several reviewers describe the headbands as well made and of great quality.","cites":[1,2,3,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the fit inconsistent, with some bands tighter or bulkier than others.","cites":[1,2,5]},{"text":"A few note the headbands lack elasticity and don't stay in place well.","cites":[1,9]}]},"qa":[]}